    {
      "id": "a2.health.bad-week",
      "level": "A2",
      "topics": ["health"],
      "title": "A bad week",
      "text": "Last Monday Elena woke up with a headache and a sore throat. She felt very tired, so she stayed in bed. On Tuesday she had a fever and went to the doctor. The doctor said she had a bad cold. He gave her some medicine and told her to rest and drink a lot of water. By Friday she felt much better and went back to work.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "original"
      }
    }
  ],
